{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SCREEN 640, 480\nDOUBLE BUFFER\n\nSPRITE LOAD 1,\"Graphics/hero.png\"\nSPRITE ON 1\n\nspriteX = 320\nspriteY = 240\n\nMainLoop:\n  CLSG\n\n  ; Analog movement with the left stick\n  spriteX = spriteX + (JOYAXIS(1, \"LeftX\") / 20)\n  spriteY = spriteY + (JOYAXIS(1, \"LeftY\") / 20)\n\n  ; Keep inside the screen\n  spriteX = MAX(0, MIN(640, spriteX))\n  spriteY = MAX(0, MIN(480, spriteY))\n\n  ; Right trigger = fire\n  IF JOYAXIS(1, \"RT\") > 50 THEN GOSUB Shoot\n\n  PRINTG AT 0,0,INT(spriteX) & \" - \" & INT(spriteY)\n  PRINTG AT 0,1,INT(JOYAXIS(1, \"LeftX\")) & \" - \" & INT(JOYAXIS(1, \"LeftY\"))  \n    \n  SPRITE POS 1, spriteX, spriteY\n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO MainLoop","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}